OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Fpatchy light rain and drizzle will
OL,7,Fslowly clear away to the south
OL,8,Fovernight. Becoming dry with variable
OL,9,Famounts of cloud and clear spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping through the early hours.
OL,11,FWarm and muggy. Light winds away from
OL,12,Fcoasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FSunday will be fine and dry
OL,15,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,16,Fbright or sunny spells. Feeling warm
OL,17,Fin the sunshine, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
